Z||000006||AusFiero||07-25-2001||02:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Wannabe:<BR><B>Yes, and it may have all been done before   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> .... <A HREF="http://www.blackcatcustom.com" TARGET=_blank>www.blackcatcustom.com</A> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nope, no Fiero gauges on that site that I could find. I almost canned the project if it I had. But 3 to 4 weeks delivery on custom gauges? WOW. I can manufacturer and delivery from the other side of the world in half that time. <P>Price Wise DumbA$$. I am trying to keep the costs to $75 a set which includes delivery and insurance. More talks with the printer will decide that of course.<P>There is also instructions I have put on the forum to make your own which is always an option as I did. But due to many requests I am going further with them and upping the quality stakes a lot.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000007||Haze_Performance||07-25-2001||03:28 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by varnster:<BR><B>{HAZE, THE MYTH THE LEGEND} </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>WOW...I gotta meet this guy. He sounds great.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> lol<P><BR>--------------------------------------<P>Recap: I'm not downing SuperX. Its just that there are a few things that have to be worked out before I would consider buying them again. (Better backlit & a guarantee. At least 14 days)<P>If Aus. comes out with a set, I think Ill throw them on the car & give them a go around. I like White Face Gauges.... Aus. if you ever make a set for the side lit (84 style) consider them sold..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>-<I><B><FONT COLOR="blue"><sub>Haze</sub></FONT></B></I><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">  <BR></A><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></FONT></FONT>||||reg||10
